# {{ model_repo }}

A character-level language model that generates **names of characters from
French literature** — from-scratch, in the spirit of Karpathy's
[makemore](https://github.com/karpathy/makemore). This repo holds the
**{{ run.model }}** model, one of the top performers of the onomatron benchmark
(all 11 architectures compared below).

