## Limitations

- Small training set (a few thousand names), char-level: the model can
  reproduce training names verbatim and may produce names that coincide with
  real people — they are fictional by construction, treat them as such.
- Biased towards French literature; accents are kept, everything else is
  dropped at normalization time.
- {% include "_obtic.md.j2" %}
- Local `data/external/*.txt` inputs are gitignored and declare no license;
  the derived names are facts, but their selection is not ours — see the
  dataset card.

